    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride and climb snow-covered mountain in this physics-based driving experience with realistic tire physics and minimalist visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tire Physics</strong> \u2013 Tire behaviour based on real vehicle dynamics, adapted to gameplay fun. (Still in development)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Obstacles</strong> \u2013 Ease into the mechanics with early, approachable challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A clean, atmospheric world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Ride through bright days and pitch-black nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breakage</strong>\u00a0<strong>Mechanics\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Drive carefully\u2014or your suspension won't last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Challenging Climb\u00a0</strong>\u2013 A tough climb only for the persistent to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refined Artwork\u00a0</strong>\u2013\u00a0New and remade artwork for enhanced ambience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Possible Features (Maybe):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Build custom worlds and vehicles for unique experiences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Variety\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Experience a variety of vehicles... maybe even tanks?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>\u00a0- Keep an eye out for fuel and battery levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo-Developed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mechanical engineer and now hobbyist game developer trying to make, hopefully, something fun for people to play.</p>",
